  "wpt/css_overflow/overflow-body-propagation-012": ".\n  Therefore, the <body> is able to hide its overflowing contents.\">\n<link rel=\"match\" href=\"overflow-body-propagation-012-ref.html\">\n<style>\n  html {\n    overflow: hidden;\n    height: 500px;\n  }\n  body {\n    overflow: hidden;\n    width: 0px;\n    height: 0px;\n    border: solid 200px green;\n  }\n\n  div {\n    background: red;\n    height: 200px;\n    width: 200px;\n  }\n</style></head>\n<body><div></div>",
  "wpt/css_overflow/overflow-clip-002-crash": "<div class=\"item\">",
  "wpt/css_overflow/overflow-clip-cant-scroll-ref": "<p>You should see two green squares (no red).\n<div class=\"child\"></div>\n<div class=\"child\"></div>",
  "wpt/css_overflow/overflow-clip-margin-001-ref": "<p>You should see two green squares touching each other. The one on the\n  right should be slightly larger.</p>\n<div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"spacer\" style=\"background-color: green\"></div>\n  <div class=\"parent\"></div>\n</div>",
  "wpt/css_overflow/overflow-clip-margin-001": "<p>You should see two green squares touching each other. The one on the\n  right should be slightly larger.</p>\n<div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"spacer\" style=\"width: 90px; background-color: green\"></div>\n  <div class=\"spacer\" style=\"width: 10px\"></div>\n  <div class=\"parent\">\n    <div class=\"child\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
  "wpt/css_overflow/overflow-clip-margin-002-ref": "<p>You should see a green box with scrollbars.</p>\n<div class=\"scroller\">\n  <div class=\"child\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<p>You should see a green box with scrollbars.</p>\n<div class=\"scroller\">\n  <div class=\"child\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<p>You should see a green box with no scrollbars.</p>\n<div class=\"scroller\" style=\"background-color: green\">\n</div>",
  "wpt/css_overflow/overflow-clip-margin-002": "<p>You should see a green box with scrollbars.</p>\n<div class=\"scroller\">\n  <div class=\"parent\">\n    <div class=\"child\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<p>You should see a green box with scrollbars.</p>\n<div class=\"scroller\">\n  <div class=\"parent\" style=\"overflow-clip-margin: 100px\">\n    <div class=\"child\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<p>You should see a green box with no scrollbars.</p>\n<div class=\"scroller\">\n  <div class=\"parent\" style=\"background-color: green\">\n  </div>\n</div>",
  "wpt/css_overflow/overflow-clip-margin-004-ref": "<p>You should see two green squares touching each other. The one on the\n  right should be slightly larger.</p>\n<div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"spacer\" style=\"background-color: green\"></div>\n  <div class=\"parent\"></div>\n</div>",
  "wpt/css_overflow/overflow-clip-margin-004": "<p>You should see two green squares touching each other. The one on the\n  right should be slightly larger.</p>\n<div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"spacer\" style=\"width: 90px; background-color: green\"></div>\n  <div class=\"spacer\" style=\"width: 10px\"></div>\n  <div class=\"parent\">\n    <div class=\"child\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
  "wpt/css_overflow/overflow-clip-margin-005-ref": "<p>You should see a green box with scrollbars.</p>\n<div class=\"scroller\">\n  <div class=\"child\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<p>You should see a green box with scrollbars.</p>\n<div class=\"scroller\">\n  <div class=\"child\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<p>You should see a green box with no scrollbars.</p>\n<div class=\"scroller\" style=\"background-color: green\">\n</div>",
  "wpt/css_overflow/overflow-clip-margin-005": "<p>You should see a green box with scrollbars.</p>\n<div class=\"scroller\">\n  <div class=\"parent\">\n    <div class=\"child\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<p>You should see a green box with scrollbars.</p>\n<div class=\"scroller\">\n  <div class=\"parent\" style=\"overflow-clip-margin: 100px\">\n    <div class=\"child\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<p>You should see a green box with no scrollbars.</p>\n<div class=\"scroller\">\n  <div class=\"parent\" style=\"background-color: green\">\n  </div>\n</div>",
